  title={Genetic data of SARS-CoV-2 within Brazilian munici-palities during the early stage (Feb 25–April 30, 2020) of the virus’s introduction were obtained for validation by the analysis reported by Candido and colleagues.18 This dataset provides information on inferred origin locations of sampled cases by use of a continuous phylogeographical model. We also used SARS-CoV-2 genomic data},
